        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Majority of heatstroke patients at AKUH lack sodium and potassium"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Be careful not to get dehydrated."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "An analysis of the 353 heatstroke patients received at the Aga Khan University Hospital during the last five days - 31 of them died - indicates that most of them had low levels of sodium and potassium from excessive sweating."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Most affected individuals can replenish their salt and water with ORS or a sports drink. However, patients with an illness should always consult with their physician first,\" said Dr Munawar Khursheed, Consultant Emergency Medicine, AKUH."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Heatstroke can occur when your body temperature rises to 40°C or higher. Avoid a heatstroke by following some very simple steps: wear loose clothing, avoid direct exposure to the sun and drink plenty of fluids. If you notice the symptoms of overheating, high body temperature, red or dry skin, a rapid pulse, a throbbing headache or dizziness, go to a hospital immediately,\" he added."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Although the number of heatstroke patients arriving at the city hospitals has reduced, AKUH still received 43 patients in the last 24 hours. No new deaths were reported by the Hospital."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
